r-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Adding on that Adam is kind of known as one of the big reasons the White Fang went to the hyper aggressive violent aspects it'll probably not change much. I mean unless she finds out that she's somewhat involved at this point I think she'd be willing to right off Adam as a complete psycho who might have gotten lucky enough to have a decently justifiable cause.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-16T14:57:02-08:00","id":1281192,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noneofyourbusiness</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's not clear of course, but my impression was more that they were killed in the crossfire. Like a roof fell on them or something.</div> </div> </div> </div>The kids were standing behind Ozma when Salem shot a fireball at him. If he didn't try to defend himself, or failed, their children would have died instantly.<br /> <br /> What sort of mother wouldn't tell a servant to take her children out of the building before she brings it down? Or at least get away from their father before she tried to incinerate him?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-16T19:45:30-08:00","id":1281241,"title":"","content":"a fun find on tumblr:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://peachinessa.tumblr.com/post/182067826954/okay-but-this-edit-got-regognized-by-arryn-on\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://peachinessa.tumblr.com/post/182067826954/okay-but-this-edit-got-regognized-by-arryn-on\" target=\"_blank\"> Not found. </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://peachinessa.tumblr.com/post/182067826954/okay-but-this-edit-got-regognized-by-arryn-on\" target=\"_blank\"> https://peachinessa.tumblr.com/post/182067826954/okay-but-this-edit-got-regognized-by-arryn-on </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> and a not so fun find:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://cenizacaer.tumblr.com/post/182068710275/hey-everyone\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://cenizacaer.tumblr.com/post/182068710275/hey-everyone\" target=\"_blank\"> Not found. </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://cenizacaer.tumblr.com/post/182068710275/hey-everyone\" target=\"_blank\"> http://cenizacaer.tumblr.com/post/182068710275/hey-everyone </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-17T12:10:50-08:00","id":1281334,"title":"","content":"How many people are aware that &quot;Semblance&quot; is a synonym of the word &quot;Aura&quot;?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-17T12:18:33-08:00","id":1281337,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noneofyourbusiness</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Newbie question (well, newbie to this particular thread), is the RWBY thread in the Exalted forum just because of a vague similarity in setting (i.e. fighting monsters, incredible feats possible with Aura and Semblances) or another reason?</div> </div> </div> </div>Back on the old forums, RWBY popped up in Exalted for the interests in the show and the parallels to the game with the trailers, annnnd just kind of stuck, even when it moved over here. THere was a brief time where I put up a bit of a fight to get the discussion over into Off Topic during the beginning of Season 2, but gave up when it became clear the discussional mass and interest for the topic was here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-17T12:19:50-08:00","id":1281339,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1266310-rwby-volume-6?p=1281334#post1281334\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How many people are aware that &quot;Semblance&quot; is a synonym of the word &quot;Aura&quot;?</div> </div> </div> </div><img src=\"https://media.makeameme.org/created/is-it-though-5b0c0c.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> I think it's more like they're related concepts. An aura is a sort of emanation while a semblance is more a vague allusion or remnant.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-17T12:44:11-08:00","id":1281349,"title":"","content":"According to the dictionary, yes, it is. The words are synonyms of each other, so it makes a certain sense to name related concepts with synonyms.<br /> <br /> Certainly, when I coin a new term to categorize some function of Aura, I try to choose the most appropriate synonym.<br /> <br /> For example, I hate referring to both &quot;soul-energy fuel&quot; and &quot;the skill of using Aura to protect one's self&quot; as &quot;Aura&quot;, so I'm calling that skill &quot;Quality&quot;.<br /> <br /> The Aura-like energy that Yang and Adam generate with their Semblances to unleash their full power? I call that energy &quot;Mien&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-17T15:50:02-08:00","id":1281387,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noneofyourbusiness</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">That depends how big the effect from her red energy orb that we never saw land would have been. A really bad mother, no one's disputing that. She should have had a servant take them out of the building like you said. But I don't think she had any deliberate plan to murder them, or was thinking rationally other than trying to destroy Oz for trying to take them away from her.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oz doesn't even die if he's killed, and she's aware of that. So assuming she wasn't randomly trying to murder her children for no reason (which seems like a <i>reasonable</i> assumption, given that she hadn't really given any hint that she was like that before), I'm not sure she was that far into the wrong given that Ozpin's solution to a disagreement over theology was to kidnap the kids and run in the dead of night.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/517-aquillion","name":"Aquillion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar517_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-17T16:22:04-08:00","id":1281392,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aquillion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1266310-rwby-volume-6?p=1281387#post1281387\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oz doesn't even die if he's killed, and she's aware of that. So assuming she wasn't randomly trying to murder her children for no reason (which seems like a <i>reasonable</i> assumption, given that she hadn't really given any hint that she was like that before), I'm not sure she was that far into the wrong given that Ozpin's solution to a disagreement over theology was to kidnap the kids and run in the dead of night.</div> </div> </div> </div>To be fair said difference in theology was between the options of &quot;better the world to bring back the old gods hoping that makes the world much better&quot; and &quot;screw every other living thing on the planet we can just make better ones.&quot; So not exactly as minor a killing as of or from the dragons.<br /> <br /> If we're optimistic about the two of them ,despite the presumption that they killed their kids during the fight, it is possible that the initial strikes were meant to incapacitate the other and let the kids get some ground where they'd be safe and the kids were killed while the power getting thrown around escalated and the kids hadn't left the building yet. After all we saw how devastated the castle was and we did see at least one blast that cleared out all the windows in the building with a fireball, if the kids didn't leave the building its entirely possible that Salem and Ozma could have accidentally killed them while being in a different part of the building entirely.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-17T19:52:21-08:00","id":1281433,"title":"","content":"I think we can all agree that Salem and Oz need all the relationship therapy the world can give them. Fortunately Oz has died a lot, so they don't need to go through any messy divorce proceedings.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-17T21:25:03-08:00","id":1281445,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noneofyourbusiness</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I did notice that he didn't even try <i>talking</i> Salem out of her notion of replacing mankind when she voiced it.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm still hoping that that line doesn't mean what some people have interpreted it as, mostly because that comes <i>completely out of nowhere</i> given her characterization and goals in the rest of the episode. I read it as her wanting to replace the gods (with themselves), not wanting to replace humanity.<br /> <br /> (I mean, I admit &quot;cackling genocide for no reason&quot; is probably the intent, but it makes absolutely no sense in the context of the episode - it's basically just &quot;ok, she needs to be Chaotic Evil now, so we're going to have her randomly advocate genocide out of nowhere for no reason whatsoever because that's the most evil thing we can think to have her do.&quot; There's literally no buildup to it at all. Whereas &quot;we shouldn't try to appease the gods, we should take their place&quot; - while still <i>somewhat</i> villainous in the sense that she's trying to take the place of a pair of monstrous, murderous, hypocritically self-righteous tyrants - fits the story of the episode up to that point perfectly and make actual sense in the context of her discussions with Ozpin earlier in the scene. And it can be interpreted as less villainous depending on what she means by &quot;better&quot;; certainly being better than the Brothers is not hard given their petty, childish nature and the infantile way in which they create and destroy sentient life.)<br /> <br /> Even then, there's some hints that she's being corrupted by the God of Darkness' Evil Juice, which would mean it's still ultimately his fault and that killing him might free her.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":517,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/517-aquillion","user":"Aquillion","date":". 01-18-2019, 12:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/517-aquillion","name":"Aquillion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar517_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-18T10:05:37-08:00","id":1281527,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noneofyourbusiness</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Her exact words were, &quot;Why spend our lives trying to redeem these humans when we can replace them with what they could never be?&quot; So it's explicitly about replacing humanity, there was no other &quot;them&quot; in that sentence and &quot;what they could never be&quot; refers to not having magic like Salem and Oz had just discovered their children had. Especially as this came after they had already replaced the gods with themselves. No need to declare an intent to do what they'd already done. And replacing the gods was also the same as &quot;redeem[ing] these humans&quot;. She explicitly said they should give up on that.</div> </div> </div> </div>None, Aquillion has been on this whole kick that Salem is actually the good guy in this scenario since they showed the gods wiping out the world. Its why he's saying the idea that she'd want to slaughter everyone else is out of nowhere when she explicitly expressed her intent to sacrifice countless humans in the hopes that it would piss the gods off enough that they might kill her. So you're just smacking your head against a wall.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-18T11:31:51-08:00","id":1281539,"title":"","content":"Does no one want to talk about how Warstriders are now canon to Remnant?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-18T13:49:50-08:00","id":1281566,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1266310-rwby-volume-6?p=1281539#post1281539\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does no one want to talk about how Warstriders are now canon to Remnant?</div> </div> </div> </div>Frankly I'm more curious about the hard light dust or whatever they said there were for the shields.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-18T14:03:10-08:00","id":1281572,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1266310-rwby-volume-6?p=1281566#post1281566\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Frankly I'm more curious about the hard light dust or whatever they said there were for the shields.</div> </div> </div> </div>Why? We already saw it employed with the road-side barriers of the high-rise streets in Vale, the audience-protecting barriers of Amity Coliseum, and Velvet's Box.<br /> <br /> Hard-light Dust creates temporary objects of mass and durability. These constructs are so temporary that machines have to keep spending energy or more hard-light Dust to maintain the existence of the constructs.<br /> <br /> Stone walls and ice walls are not transparent, so hardlight walls cannot be used as visual cover to establish stealth, but it allows you to keep sight of your enemies in turn, and hardlight can probably be manipulated to create one-way barriers.<br /> <br /> The temporary nature of hardlight constructs can be used to make barriers that block the passage or attacks of an enemy with a construct that disappears afterwards, allowing the passage or attacks of your allies. It can let you create a bridge or ladder for an ally that disappears before an enemy can use it to follow them.<br /> <br /> Weiss has made her ice-constructs disappear when their continued existence would get in her way (as per the surrounding ice-spear wall in the Weiss Short), but that probably takes an effort of will and control. Her Earth wall, on the other hand, has NOT disappeared even after its purpose is fulfilled and the ice behind it would cover them just as well.<br /> <br /> She probably made an Earth wall because she conjured more rock from the ground in front of her, so that it's all one solid piece, and thus harder to destroy or move.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-18T16:28:42-08:00","id":1281589,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1266310-rwby-volume-6?p=1281539#post1281539\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does no one want to talk about how Warstriders are now canon to Remnant?</div> </div> </div> </div>Haven't they been since season 2, when Torchwick started selling smaller versions to the White Fang?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I thank the Devs for the great game of Exalted!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12735-bjornthefellhanded","name":"BjornTheFellhanded","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12735_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"327"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-18T18:11:27-08:00","id":1281599,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1266310-rwby-volume-6?p=1281539#post1281539\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does no one want to talk about how Warstriders are now canon to Remnant?</div> </div> </div> </div>Not really?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-18T18:18:37-08:00","id":1281600,"title":"","content":"We knew about the warstriders since V2","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-19T03:38:58-08:00","id":1281630,"title":"","content":"We had warstriders since the Paladin in V2, and we have seen particularly gargantuan grimm since V4 with the sea dragon thingie. The big one is a surprise but not a bizarre one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-19T08:38:35-08:00","id":1281645,"title":"","content":"To me the shocking thing about it isn't its existence but the fact that Cordovin is trusted with it.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join 